# variation 1 of b07: over in the aspect twice: the primary aspect goes on each time
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
primary aspect b07_test1 is
  process main is
    apply leave();
    apply leave();
    print "back";
  return;
end b07_test1;
/*@expect
{
  "stdout": [
    "leave: start",
    "leave: start",
    "back"
  ]
}
